---
alwaysApply: true
description: DOM capture and style extraction rules
---

# DOM Capture Rules

Element capture must produce a portable snippet.

---

# Capture Process

Steps:

1. detect clicked element
2. clone subtree
3. traverse DOM
4. extract computed styles
5. inline styles
6. remove external assets

---

# Inline Style Rules

Only include visual styles:

```

display
position
margin
padding
font
color
background
border
flex
grid

```

Ignore:

```

transition
animation
cursor
pointer-events

```

---

# Asset Handling

Replace:

```

img
svg
video
canvas

```

with placeholders.

---

# Script Removal

Remove:

```

script
iframe
tracking pixels

```

---

# Output HTML

Output must be:

```

clean
portable
framework neutral

```

---

# Export Formats

Generate:

```

HTML
JSX

```

JSX must convert style syntax correctly.
```